copier: Copier answers
profiles: Profile axes
template: template/
generated: Generated project

copier -> profiles: project_type + runtime_level
profiles -> template: select files and Jinja branches
template -> generated: render scaffold

generated.state: project/state.yaml
generated.tasks: project/tasks/*.md
generated.docs: README + project docs
generated.tools: tools/project.py + Makefile

generated.state -> generated.docs: sync dashboard blocks
generated.tasks -> generated.docs: task status and next action
generated.tools -> generated.docs: validate links, commands, profile drift
